*begin CatHole

*export CatHole1.1.0

*entrance CatHole1.1.0 ;GPS point head height above entrance marked with a triangle

;*fix CatHole1.1.0 374852 470010 228   ;Estimated coordinates from google earth
; Note from Becka, drop leading 3 and 4 in coordinates if using the *cs OSGB:SD command as the SD replaces those numbers I believe, so this would give *fix CatHole1.1.0 74852 70010 228

*include CatHole1
*include CatHole2
*include CatHole3

*equate CatHole1.1.24 CatHole2.1.24
